      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lineboro%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When the Baltimore‑and‑Hanover Railroad arrived in 1877, a feed mill and store sprang up beside the tracks.",
