        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://apps.mht.maryland.gov/nr/NRDetail.aspx?NRID=1180&COUNTY=Carroll&FROM=NRCountyList.aspx",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1996, most of Lineboro was listed on the National Register as the Lineboro Historic District.",
